TRANSLATION:
Hey, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}, sana göre olduğunu
düşündüğüm küçük bir şey var.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Şu {{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
kime vereceğimi uzun uzun düşündüm;
sonra doğru kişinin SEN
olduğunu anladım.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¿Cómo dices? Claro que lo dijiste,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}. ¡Cómo vas a dudar de
mí, con lo buen amigo que soy!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000A:0000:0306000700CD}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Tu parles que c'est toi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Ma mémoire est garantie sans bug,
tu sais ?{{TAG:000A:0000:0306000700CD}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Cosa? Sono sicuro di sì, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.
Sembro uno tutto gel e muscoli, ma
ho una gran memoria, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000A:0000:0306000700CD}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Ich kann mich genau dran erinnern,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}} Schließlich bin ich ein
extrem guter Zuhörer.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000A:0000:0306000700CD}}

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Selbst wenn ich mich irren sollte...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sieh es einfach als Zeichen unserer
guten Freundschaft, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Either way, we're sort of on our
way to being friends, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
So take this item. {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}It's all yours.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Wie auch immer, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Kleine Geschenke erhalten die
Freundschaft.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Hier, bitte.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Her hâlükârda arkadaş olma yolunda
ilerliyoruz sayılır, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
O yüzden bunu al. {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Tamamen senin.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:001C:}}Non, non, {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}me remercie pas...
{{TAG:0000:0003:0500}}(Franchement, {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}ce truc est bon
pour la poubelle de toute façon...){{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Eh ben,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} tant d'honnêteté, c'est rare.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Justement, ça mérite une belle
récompense... {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}Tiens.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} J'insiste !

ES:
¿No lo has leído en mi blog?
La razón es muy sencilla:
{{TAG:0003:002C:}}¡me siento especialmente generoso!{{TAG:0009:0000:0F001000}}

EN:
Here—{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
just for you!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Oh, it's nothing much. But don't
forget that a whole lot of nothing
adds up to a ton of.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} {{TAG:0003:000B:}}Uh, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}wait.
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}I think I have my math wrong.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Anyway, enjoy the gift!

TRANSLATION:
Al—{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
sırf senin için!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Çok büyük bir şey değil.
Ama unutma, bir sürü hiçlik birikince
koskoca bir...{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} {{TAG:0003:000B:}}Şey, {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}dur.
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Galiba hesabı yanlış yaptım.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Neyse, hediyenin tadını çıkar!
